# =========================================================================
# Environment Variables Configuration
# =========================================================================
# By default, ReviewVault uses the built-in LocalStorage adapter with rich
# sample data. It works immediately out-of-the-box with zero configuration!
#
# To connect your cloud database or backend, provide either option below:

# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 1: Supabase (PostgreSQL) - RECOMMENDED
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Run the schema.sql in your Supabase SQL Editor
# 2. Add your project URL and public Anon Key:
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://xyzcompany.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 2: Custom REST API Backend (Express, Hono, FastAPI, etc.)
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com/v1
# VITE_API_KEY=your_secret_api_key

# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Netlify Deployment:
# Add these variables under Site Settings -> Environment Variables in Netlify
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
